* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exactness fixtures for the blob round-trip test. `text=auto` decides binary-ness by
# sniffing for NUL bytes and would normally get these right, but a heuristic is not a
# guarantee and eol=lf mangling would corrupt them silently. Say it explicitly.
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore
